<story-context story="6.4.4" title="Prompt Shrink Sweeps H1/H2/H4">

  <overview>
    Run the first measured prompt shrink experiments using the completed
    harness, judge, ingest, diff, and statistics stack. Dev tests H1 locale
    shrink, H2 consent/legal shrink, H4 operational-notes trim, and the
    combined H1+H2+H4 interaction variant. Only evidence-backed winners ship.
  </overview>

  <critical-objectives>
    <item>Preserve prompts-v1.0 benchmark and rubric_v1; do not mutate them.</item>
    <item>Run single-variable variants plus combined variant with distinct run IDs.</item>
    <item>Use diff/statistics reports for verdicts, not subjective inspection alone.</item>
    <item>Revert losers before merge.</item>
    <item>Record final evidence in STORY-6.4.4-HYPOTHESIS-EVIDENCE.md.</item>
  </critical-objectives>

  <dependencies>
    <story id="6.4.3a">Eval harness and baseline.</story>
    <story id="6.4.2">Capability snapshot cleanup and post-cleanup baseline.</story>
    <story id="6.4.3b">Judge package, rubric, and ingest.</story>
    <story id="6.4.3c">Diff/statistics tooling.</story>
    <doc path="docs/stories/story-6.4.4.md">Authoritative story spec.</doc>
    <doc path="docs/FORM-AI-EVAL-HARNESS.md">Harness run docs.</doc>
    <doc path="docs/FORM-AI-EVAL-JUDGE-WORKFLOW.md">Judge workflow docs.</doc>
    <doc path="docs/FORM-AI-EVAL-DIFF-STATS.md">Diff/statistics docs.</doc>
  </dependencies>

  <constraints>
    <item>Do NOT change prompts.yaml or rubric_v1.md.</item>
    <item>Do NOT implement H3/H5/H6 or Image-to-Form.</item>
    <item>Do NOT keep prompt changes that fail structural blockers.</item>
    <item>Do NOT run Alembic. No migration expected.</item>
    <item>Use PowerShell-safe commands; no && chaining.</item>
  </constraints>

  <primary-code-paths>
